                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 13837/2.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Dodge to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">San
                                Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-06-03"><hi rendition="#italic">June 3,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Dodge reports that the minister for foreign affairs of Honduras has ordered
                    the arrest of Bailey and the detention of the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Goldsboro</hi> cargo.</p>
            </div>
